mic-icon

lightweight mic status indicator for the systray
like volumeicon but for microphones

dependencies
    python 3
    pulsectl
    pygobject
    pactl (pulseaudio or pipewire-pulse)
    gtk 3.0
    appindicator3

install

    python -m venv .venv
    source .venv/bin/activate
    pip install .

    symlink .venv/bin/mic-icon into your PATH
    run on startup or however you want

license: 0bsd
